 preserve-3d; opacity: 0;\" role=\"list\" class=\"our-list\"><li class=\"our-list-item\">Using modern technology to dental disease.</li><li class=\"our-list-item\">24/7 medical service through online and offline.</li><li class=\"our-list-item\">Easy and flexible to appoint a doctor.</li></ul><div class=\"our-story-group-block\"><div class=\"our-highlighted-doctor-block\"><div class=\"our-highlighted-doctor-avatar-block\"><div class=\"global-image-block left-to-right\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671f49fca67a34c410c2515c/6739859ab0f7e2eae3be7463_our-highlighted-doctor-avatar.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Our Highlighted Doctor Avatar\" class=\"global-image\"><div class=\"global-image-overlay white-bg\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"0c106d23-eb46-1707-f643-b28ac2192ac0\" class=\"our-highlighted-doctor-content\"><div style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 20px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d; opacity: 0;\" class=\"our-highlighted-doctor-name\">Dr. Elisabeth Lie</div><p style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 20px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d; opacity: 0;\" class=\"our-highlighted-doctor-role\">Sr. Dentist at Niko</p></div></div><div class=\"our-highlighted-patient-avatar-block\"><div class=\"global-image-block right-to-left\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671f49fca67a34c410c2515c/6721fe7da8bcfa1c9a6f6491_our-highlighted-patient-avatar.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Our Highlighted Patient Avatar\" class=\"our-highlighted-patient-avatar\"><div class=\"global-image-overlay white-bg\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"
